                           Control structure

--> Control Structure help us control the flow of execution of a program based on certain conditions.
1. Conditional Statement
--> if, if-else, if-elif-else
2. Loops
--> for, while, until

1. conditional statement
if-else
--> when we want to execute one block if the condition is true and another block if condition is false.
syntax:
if [ condition ]
then 
    #commmands if condition is true
else
    #commands if condition is false
fi 

